+curve map gives \(m_{\widetilde p}(\widetilde g)=1\), and Proposition 1 on the
+published-linear transverse terminal chain gives degree
+\(1\cdot n(\widetilde g)=2\).  **LEMMA 6: REPLAYED-SOUND.**
