+### 5.2 Degrees two and three: published Lemma 8
+
+For \(m=2,n=1\) the three rows, Russian Figs. 3--5, are
+
+\[
+2\mid2\mid11,\qquad 2\mid11\mid2,\qquad 11\mid2\mid2. \tag{5.2}
+\]
