+| \((3,1)\) | \(3,3,1+1+1\), or \(3,2+1,2+1\) | 6 |
+| \((4,1)\) | triples of partitions of 4 with six total parts | 23 |
+| \((2,2)\) | one direction \(2+2\), the other two \(4\) | 3 |
