+|---|---|---|
+| \((1,2)\) | campaign Proposition 4.1, exactly its all-\(\mu=1\) slice | **REPAIRED** |
+| \((2,1)\) | §§2--7 of the authoritative part-I text, with the bounded fills listed below | **REPLAYED-SOUND after named repairs** |
